{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06635","headline":"贻崔太祝 · 储光羲","name":"贻崔太祝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天都分礼阁，肃肃临清渠。\n春山照前屏，高槐荫内除。\n惟贤尚廪禄，弟去兄来居。\n文雅更骧首，风流信有余。\n中年幸从事，乃遇两吹嘘。\n何以知君子，交情复淡如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}